<p><a href="https://inktober.com" target="_blank">Learn about the Inktober Challenge</a></p>
<p>Inktober: one image per day from a list of prompts. Last year I made it to day 20 before running out of steam but was proud of myself for getting that far. Let’s see what this year brings!</p>
<div class="right margin">
<a href="https://ellanew.com/2026/10/01/inktober-apple"><img src="https://cdn.blot.im/blog_177bc256f0ee469c998e912e20ece048/_image_cache/3c44a3d3-fa66-4720-99c5-7be071f53bd4/pasted-percent20image-percent2020261001212655.png" alt="Ink drawing close up of the top part of an apple, comprised of the letters in the word ‘apple’. The illustration has a square border made from block capitals of the word APPLE repeated." width="1410" height="1410"></a>
