<p>I’ve set a personal constraint of only using combinations of the letters of the word, within a 2-inch square, to illustrate each concept. Much artistic license taken with letter shapes, of course! I’ll be using a Hongdian Black Forest fountain pen with extra fine nib, and black ink.</p>
